OL,3,GNEWSAChief medical officer Gregor Smith
OL,4,Aresigns on mental health grounds       
OL,6,FFirst minister John Swinney thanked    
OL,7,FSmith for his service, adding that he  
OL,8,Fhad led the country through "one of the
OL,9,Fmost demanding periods the Scottish    
OL,10,Fhealth service has faced."             
